# PC card team-counters (docs/plan-team-top5.md section 11, TMODE-20..24, BENCH-123): screen s2, each team's second counter, against aa on its own teams. Template: tcprep writes work/team-counters-s2.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
16
--seed-base
4600
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
work/team-counters-s2.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur2.HadurTeam_@V@kb.jar
--robot
hadur2.HadurTeam @V@kb
--member
hadur2.Hadur
--out
work/team-counters-@V@-s2
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-counters-s2.md
--baseline
